From 388910c5d251d92a748ff4d6041f5c7c0eba55d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: M4n5ter <m4n5terrr@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 23:04:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(runtime): fence node-pty writes at PTY exit

node-pty can leave async raw-fd writes queued after a Unix PTY exits, allowing descriptor reuse to redirect terminal input into unrelated files.

Patch the dependency at its write-lifecycle boundary and add a deterministic exact-fd-reuse regression that fails against the unpatched package.

